### Reuse revoked the whole family: the child Dana's first refresh received is dead too
# @name ChildAfterReuse
## TEST-EXPECT-STATUS: [400]
POST {{fsBaseUrl}}/auth/v1/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=refresh_token&refresh_token={{DanaChildRefresh}}

### And so is the session the family belonged to: her newest access token
# @name AccessAfterReuse
## TEST-EXPECT-STATUS: [401]
GET {{fsBaseUrl}}/auth/v1/user
Authorization: Bearer {{DanaLatestAccess}}

### Theo's session is his own, and reuse of Dana's token does not touch it
# @name TheoStillSignedIn
## TEST-EXPECT-STATUS: [200]
GET {{fsBaseUrl}}/auth/v1/user
Authorization: Bearer {{TheoAccess}}
